---
import ColoredRow from "../components/ColoredRow.astro";
import Button from "../components/Button.astro";
---

<ColoredRow id="install">
  <h2>Get Regulus</h2>
  <p class="narrow">Regulus ships as a Flatpak. While it's still pre-release, you build and install it from source:</p>
  <pre><code>git clone https://github.com/maybejaishkhan/regulus
cd regulus
flatpak-builder --force-clean --user --install --ccache build-dir packages/flatpak/dev.jaish.Regulus.yml
flatpak run dev.jaish.Regulus</code></pre>
  <p class="narrow">Then pick <strong>Windows 11</strong> or <strong>Windows 10</strong> IoT Enterprise LTSC, choose a preset, and let Regulus download the image and set up Windows for you.</p>
  <p><Button variant="dark" standalone href="https://github.com/maybejaishkhan/regulus">Source &amp; issues</Button></p>
</ColoredRow>
